<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Reggies raises 10.45 mln rand from market.</title>
<headline>Reggies raises 10.45 mln rand from market.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Redgwoods Holdings Ltd (Reggies) said on Wednesday that it had raised 10.45 million rand by a placing of 5.5 million ordinary shares at 190 cents each.</p>
<p>The firm said it had decided to tap the market for extra cash because it is planning a roll out of new stores in its Toys &quot;R&quot; Us, Baby and Co and Hi-Fi Corp operations.</p>
<p>&quot;The funds raised by the issue will be used to finance this expansion,&quot; Reggies said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom + 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
